ntract [1], for 38,459.26 euros, was awarded in November 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The high ratio shows a pattern, but it doesn't prove any breach. Prices might be standard, budgets fixed, or needs separate. Statistical trends don't mean wrongdoing in individual cases.\nWhat can be checked: Check contract details for consistency. Look at awardee A's other contracts to see if they repeat similar purchases. Review contract [1] to see if the amount aligns with market rates for the work described.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"obras","citas":["7Y5xrbI6HpAeIBJRHQiPkQ%3D%3D","eY1RBzTv8Sp4zIRvjBVCSw%3D%3D","1%2B6aFEX442AIYE3ZiZ%2BxmQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}